{"id":"n82044-2-4","stage":1,"title":"통화 · 通话","scene":"借用电话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82044-2-4-1","ko":"죄송하지만 전화 한 통화만 쓸 수 있을까요?","zh":"不好意思，能借用一下电话吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송하지만","audio":"/audio/8f5e03e932bf717d558b.mp3"}},{"text":"전화","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一（한 통화：一通电话）","explanation":"한：一（한 통화：一通电话）。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"통화만","meaning":"只打一通电话","explanation":"한 통화：一通电话；-만 表示“只、仅”。这里请求借电话打一次。","readings":[{"term":"통화","audio":"/audio/1566f907a6cafa98c014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82044","senseId":"2","lemma":"통화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통화만","audio":"/audio/fffa4ea4f2682acad9f5.mp3"}},{"text":"쓸","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓸","audio":"/audio/fe874efc41706f784970.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있을까요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을까요","audio":"/audio/ef6f1745d773e6085ac3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"把说话声变成电波或电流发送出去，使相隔很远的人也可以互相对话的机器。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一（한 통화：一通电话）","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一（한 통화：一通电话）","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"1566f907a6cafa98","term":"통화","zh":"一通电话","audio":"/audio/1566f907a6cafa98c014.mp3","entryId":"82044","definition":"计算通话次数的单位；这里指借用电话打一次。","pronunciation":["통화"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/dabb8cf0cb2d2a1c323e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82044-2-4-2","ko":"물론이죠. 얼마든지 쓰세요.","zh":"当然可以，随便用吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물론이죠.","meaning":"当然，不用说","explanation":"물론：当然，不用说；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"물론","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89812","senseId":"1","lemma":"물론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물론이죠","audio":"/audio/951db0b0bc495a3968bd.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마든지","meaning":"随便、尽管","explanation":"얼마든지：无论多少都可以；这里表示可以随意使用电话。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마든지","audio":"/audio/c5c4c52e3dc65a8c13a7.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰세요.","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰세요","audio":"/audio/b667299362de3c582791.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86ee58f45cccde99","term":"물론","zh":"当然，不用说","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3","entryId":"89812","definition":"没有必要说的。","pronunciation":["물론"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少（얼마든지：随便）","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"与 -든지 合用为 얼마든지，表示数量不限；这里是“尽管使用”。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e78630de9f0013f01071.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82044","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6653,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不好意思，能借用一下电话吗？","当然可以，随便用吧。","需要我在咖啡里加糖吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不好意思，能借用一下电话吗？","当然可以，随便用吧。","需要我在咖啡里加糖吗？"],"answer":1}]}
